        "accession_number": "0001342423-25-000039",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "East Area I is the location of our master planned community of commercial and residential properties, named Harvest at Limoneira, designed to satisfy expected demand in a region that we believe will have few other developments in this coming decade.",
